  "body": "You'll fall in love with this sunny, brand-new home in a highly convenient location. Seize this wonderful opportunity to secure a brilliant family home.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Brand-new, solid, and modern two-level homes on freehold titles, featuring quality interiors and stylish finishes throughout\r\n• Five double bedrooms plus three family bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n• Two spacious living areas with high ceilings and an open-plan modern kitchen\r\n• Excellent indoor-outdoor flow to an entertainer's deck — perfect for relaxed outdoor living\r\n• Double internal-access garage plus off-street parking\r\n\r\nTop School Zones:\r\nRangitoto College, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate, and Sherwood School.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location:\r\nSituated in sought-after Browns Bay, this home is close to parks and reserves. Enjoy Sherwood Reserve and Freyberg Park right on your doorstep, and take an easy walk to Browns Bay beach, shops, a wide variety of restaurants and cafés, the community centre, and clubs for all ages.\r\n\r\nThis superb location makes it the perfect place for you to take advantage of everything the area has to offer.",
